DateHack -- General Information August 2025

DateHack is a variant of the dungeon exploration game NetHack. In it, you
enter the Mazes of Menace to find the Amulet of Yendor... and love.

Perhaps the true Amulet of Yendor was the love you found along the way?
(Spoiler: No, it's still an amulet.)

DateHack is based on NetHack 3.6.7. Please follow instructions in the main
repo to compile and install.

DateHack may be freely redistributed.  See license for details.
